Package: modelterms
Type: Package
Title: Safe Manipulation and Extraction of Model Terms
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ryoichi", "Asashiba", email = "ryoichi.asashiba@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-9532-7000"))
  )
Description: A lightweight, zero-dependency suite of functions to seamlessly 
    manipulate terms objects, formulas, fitted models, and character 
    vectors of term labels. It provides robust coercion, three-level variable 
    extraction, declarative term filtering, and order-invariant label matching 
    for statistical modeling workflows.
